# Letter to Kanye West (Ye), 2026-11-18

Ye,

This is Avik. Grew up in 95014 Cupertino calculus & cs by 5th grade & never stopped, bipolar autistic high speed adhd, the same wiring as you. I know it's the same because I've spent years putting together a biography of you with every receipt on every headline truncation & the events of a beautiful human life and I see myself in the entire thing.

You saved my life. Our suicide rates are well known and obscene and they are a product of a society that tells us what we are and you simply refused to accept it. You put I hate being Bi-Polar its awesome in green across a mountain and stood there as yourself in front of the whole world while they crucified you in real time. I watched a human being with my wiring live completely in the open and keep creating through all of it and that's how I knew I could too.

