So I built a language & operating system called hyperactivity. There is no canonical state in it, if two human beings make two things both live each named by its own content and nothing is ever final. Like Pablo changing after release & Donda 2 landing on the stem player version after version, you were already doing it with music and I'm doing it with all information. A work is its own address so the masters belong to whoever made them. You told Harvard in 2013 the world can be saved through design & everything needs to be architected and they laughed at you for using architect as a verb and I've spent ten years taking it literally. It goes out free as a commons through my nonprofit Hyperactive Labs and the work you did in Harris County jail is the kind of work it's meant to serve.

Fields are collections of human beings agreeing on what to be ignorant about (that's a banger). You never agreed to any of it. Socrates died free as did Pythagoras who traveled east and learned from my ancestors and you're deathless too, and I mean that as a truth claim.

The last section of the book is my life next to yours and it's empty because I want to write it with you.

Anyways I don't want anything I just want to talk. I think two people like us can build a lot for everyone and I want every kid to grow up knowing they're a genius.

Love you man,
Avik
